rive_link\n虎の他の参考文献はこちら：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DZSmnP4LBIl2b0eElYOpa1w8LPOG9Br5?usp=drive_link\n虎の鼻と顔の模様に注目してください。描くときに見逃さないようにしてください。ありがとうございました！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shishimi443/works/34", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 386448, "client_id": 1800763, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/76ac0ac9/uploads/origins/d323bb81-d7a2-4b5a-a0fe-dda4a993c1b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ba060b55abde8af34fca7051dfbefe", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/76ac0ac9/uploads/origins/d323bb81-d7a2-4b5a-a0fe-dda4a993c1b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e38ef812b9dd3b7ebd4638cba3b7606b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "しじみさん、こんにちは！\nこのキャラクターは、ステージでエレキベースを演奏するために依頼したいのですが、衣装はサイバーパンクのような雰囲気にしたいと思っています！\n\nキャラクター：https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/raq8mrszfogqjdu2la5t6/Sakafursona.png?rlkey=lf8h8x6xnbcbo33e8wzxovyre&dl=0\nベース：https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/6o8rcgkka25v88398h499/iba-gsr200tr_3.jpg?rlkey=cscc3jf7amoe1c2wg3ga0cztx&dl=0", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shishimi443/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 386448, "client_id": 1246490, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef334112/uploads/origins/1dbbefc2-24a7-42df-a2c7-adbc081afe47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbfadab13b262624254fa8a4fea746bf", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef334112/uploads/origins/1dbbefc2-24a7-42df-a2c7-adbc0